# Credentials (NEVER commit)
#
# Glob patterns, not exact filenames. An exact-match rule missed
# scripts/scriptsoauth-client-bbm0902.json (a mistyped save path) and git add -A
# swept a live Google OAuth client secret into a commit. GitHub push protection
# caught it, but the ignore rule should have caught it first.
*oauth-client*.json
*yt-credentials*.json
*credentials*.json
*client_secret*.json
scripts/*.secret
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo
